## Summary
A scalper purchased tickets for an idol concert and resold them at 13 times the original price, accumulating 400 million won. The individual has been arrested for engaging in illegal ticket scalping. This case underscores the problems of unauthorized resale in the entertainment industry.

## Key Points
- Idol concert tickets were scalped for profit.
- Tickets were resold at 13 times the original price.
- The scalper made 400 million won from the operation.
- Law enforcement arrested the scalper for illegal activities.


